NOTICE
------
This repository serves as the official public technical showcase and 
concept overview for FarmersDirect — an autonomous direct farm-to-consumer 
fair commerce platform and agri-logistics mesh.

It contains high-level operational workflows, fair pricing architecture,
and product roadmap documentation ONLY.

The underlying backend marketplace engines, database schemas, dynamic
pooling algorithms, escrow payment settlement handlers, and core application
code are maintained within the author's private primary development repository
and remain the exclusive, proprietary intellectual property of Anbuselvan T.

PERMITTED USAGE
---------------
You MAY:
  1. Review, star, and share this repository for evaluation and technical review.
  2. Open GitHub issues to suggest features, inquire regarding agricultural 
     cooperative partnerships, or express interest in upcoming pilot programs.
  3. Reference the public agricultural commerce frameworks with proper attribution.

RESTRICTIONS
